# openOODA public site

File: openOODA.github.io/README.oot
Public site for https://openooda.org. Splash, research viewer, install endpoint. Not the compiler. Not the wiki (`openOODA/wiki`). Not the registry (`registry.openooda.org`).

## What is on disk

| Path | What it actually is |
| :--- | :--- |
| `index.html` | Marketing splash. Not a language tutorial. |
| `research.html` | Research paper index. Papers are design, not proof. |
| `install` / `install.sh` | Host bootstrap. Pins `v0.183.0-alpha`. No checksum. `ooda` is private, so this fetch 404s for the public. |
| `research/` | RP / ES papers. Present-tense moonshots are residual. |
| `assets/` | Branding. |

There is no playground. There are no API docs on this site. Product truth lives on the private boards: `openOODA/SHIPPED.oot`.

## Install honesty

```
curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install | sh
```

That line is documented. It is not a working public install today. The compiler repo is private. The script does not verify a hash.

## Local preview

Use any static file server. Do not add `.py` helpers.

## Residual

Native compiler, product std, and live proofs are not in this repo.
